# graphify — knowledge graph output, all of it regenerated from source by
# `graphify update .` (AST only, no API cost), so none of it is worth committing:
#   graph.json, graph.html   megabytes that churn on every code edit
#   cache/                   content-hashed extraction cache, machine-local
#   manifest.json            mtimes and hashes, differ on every machine
#   .graphify_python         absolute path to a local interpreter
#   GRAPH_REPORT.md, wiki/, obsidian/, cypher.txt, graph.svg, graph.graphml
#   <YYYY-MM-DD>/            per-run snapshot
# `.graphifyignore` IS committed — it is project configuration, not output.
# If the graph is ever wanted in version control, install graphify's union merge
# driver first (`graphify merge-driver`); without it graph.json conflicts on
# every branch.
/graphify-out/

# serena — LSP symbol cache, rebuilt on demand from the source it indexes.
# `.serena/project.yml` and `.serena/memories/` are shareable, so they are not
# ignored here.
/.serena/cache/

